10210	10302	10087	10087	Marilla	115	" Oh , it makes _ such _ a difference . It _ looks _ so much nicer . When you hear a name pronounced ca n't you always see it in your mind , just as if it was printed out ? I can ; and A - n - n looks dreadful , but A - n - n - e looks so much more distinguished . If you 'll only call me Anne spelled with an E I shall try to reconcile myself to not being called Cordelia . "
