97878	97883	97884	97884	Anne	241	" Oh , Marilla ! "
97894	97986	97884	97884	Anne	241	" It 's been the dream of my life -- that is , for the last six months , ever since Ruby and Jane began to talk of studying for the Entrance . But I did n't say anything about it , because I supposed it would be perfectly useless . I 'd love to be a teacher . But wo n't it be dreadfully expensive ? Mr. Andrews says it cost him one hundred and fifty dollars to put Prissy through , and Prissy was n't a dunce in geometry . "
